(10, 'Hotels&Resorts Near By Aluvihara Rock Cave Temple', '<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 800px; height: 600px; border: 2px solid green; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px; position: relative;\"><!-- Topic Heading -->\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Welcome to Man Mountain Villa Hotel</div>\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n<div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px; border: 2px solid green; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\"><img style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Image 1\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px; border: 2px solid green; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\"><img style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Image 2\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px; border: 2px solid green; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\"><img style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Image 3\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n<p>Set in Matale, 33 km from Kandy City Center Shopping Mall, Man Mountain Villa offers accommodation with an outdoor swimming pool, free private parking, a garden and a restaurant. With free WiFi, this 3-star hotel offers room service and a 24-hour front desk. The rooms are equipped with a balcony. All guest rooms come with air conditioning, a dishwasher, an oven, a kettle, a shower, free toiletries and a desk. All rooms feature a private bathroom, a hairdryer and bed linen.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 2px solid green; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer;\"><a title=\"Go Map\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Man+Mountain+Villa/@7.5069553,80.6052006,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m11!3m10!1s0x3ae3456171f7bcfb:0